# Auto deploy commit

When catalog, scrape, nav, image-tag, or similar product-data work finishes successfully:

1. **Commit** all related changes on `main` (message focused on why).
2. **Push** to `origin/main` immediately — do not wait for the user to say "응" or "배포".
3. Also push `product-images` (or other CDN tags) when image scripts ran.

Do this automatically every time unless the user explicitly says not to push, or the change is clearly WIP/local-only.
